   circle, as the mic and Send already are in the round look (Leo 2026-11-23: "the highlight also
   necessarily has to be a circle instead of a rounded square. that's just design.").
   Only cmux.agentPane.style/1 tokens (schemas/agent-pane/style-tokens.json), on :root: a corner is
   paint, so nothing moves when this applies or reloads. */
